# Terrace walls at eye level on the landscapes whose walls every other one
# shares a family with, at noon and in the evening: before and after any change
# to how stratum walls are drawn, with the frame cost standing on the moss.
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/lands_walls.tour --seed=7 --weather=clear:0 --view=shoulder --stats
coast calm
hour 12
place typical_moss
wait 3.0
shot moss-noon with land:moss
perf stats begin
wait 5.0
perf stats end moss-noon
hour 18.5
wait 1.5
shot moss-evening with land:moss
hour 12
place typical_pinewood
wait 3.0
shot pinewood-noon with land:pinewood
hour 12
place typical_bonelands
wait 3.0
shot bonelands-noon with land:bonelands
hour 18.5
wait 1.5
shot bonelands-evening with land:bonelands
hour 12
place typical_burning
wait 3.0
shot burning-noon with land:burning
hour 12
place typical_coast
wait 3.0
shot coast-noon with land:coast
hour 12
place typical_snowfield
wait 3.0
shot snowfield-noon with land:snowfield
hour 12
place typical_salt_flats
wait 3.0
shot salt-noon with land:salt_flats
